repomix-output.*

# ── Large source datasets ────────────────────────────────────────
# Untracked 2026-07-31. Offline builder inputs the runtime never opens; the
# artifacts built from them are committed instead (app/data/*.json), each
# recording the sha256 of its source so a rebuild can verify it has the right
# file.
#
# NOTE: this stops them growing, it does NOT purge them from history. That
# needs `git filter-repo` run from a clone with FULL history — see
# docs/HISTORY_REWRITE.md. Worth knowing before anyone assumes the clone got
# smaller: 197 MB of raw blobs is only about 10 MB of packfile, because CSVs
# compress hard.
#
# Kept in git deliberately: goalies_2008_to_2024.csv (1.5 MB) and
# teams_2008_to_2024.csv (1.6 MB) are small and drive the goalie work, and
# OtherData/contracts/ is hand-built and cannot be re-downloaded at all.
OtherData/HistoricalData/lines_2008_to_2024.csv
OtherData/HistoricalData/skaters_2008_to_2024.csv
